From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 03:25:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 272/488] soh: rename func_80A505CC -> EnGuest_UpdateMain

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the update installed in place of EnGuest_Update once the object bank has loaded; it runs the blink, the action function, head tracking, the fidget tables, the skeleton update and the collision checks. Named "Main" because EnGuest_Update is already taken by the object-waiting update in ActorInit.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Guest/z_en_guest.c
