 void EnGuest_Talk(EnGuest* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A5057C [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80A505CC(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A505CC: the update installed in place of EnGuest_Update once the object bank has loaded; it runs the blink, the action function, head tracking, the fidget tables, the skeleton update and the collision checks. Named "Main" because EnGuest_Update is already taken by the object-waiting update in ActorInit.
+void EnGuest_UpdateMain(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A505CC [LLM:HIGH]
 
